  "description": "The East face of ten mile definitely wasn’t the road shoe kinda trail I thought it would be. Pretty muddy and still plenty of snow with lots of downed trees. Spent 15 minutes wandering around a swamp plus a couple other wrong turns. Western descent was heavenly though! Timed the key swap perfectly at the very top. Started with 1.5 liters of skratch water and finished with a whole liter still. Western States watch party at my place come on by!",
